.\" Man page for neoterm
.\" Generated from docs/KEYBINDINGS.md
.TH NEOTERM 1 "2026-11-25" "NeoTerm 0.3.0" "NeoTerm User Manual"
.SH NAME
neoterm \- GPU terminal emulator with tabs, splits, and themes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B neoterm
[\-e \fIcommand\fR] [\-w \fIdirectory\fR] [\fIcmd\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B NeoTerm
is a GPU-accelerated terminal emulator written in pure Rust. It uses winit for
windowing, wgpu for rendering, glyphon/cosmic-text for text shaping, and
alacritty_terminal for terminal emulation.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-e, \-\-command \fIcommand\fR
Run the given command instead of the default shell.
.TP
.B \-w, \-\-working-directory \fIdirectory\fR
Start the shell in the given directory (default: $HOME).
.TP
\fIcmd\fR
One of: \fBsession\fR, \fBtheme\fR. Run \fBneoterm cmd --help\fR for details.
.SH KEYBINDINGS
All keybindings are listed in \fBKEYBINDINGS.md\fR (also installed with the
man page). Summary:
.TP
.B Tab management
Ctrl+Shift+T new tab, Ctrl+Shift+W close pane, Ctrl+Shift+N new window,
Ctrl+Tab/Shift+Tab switch tabs, Ctrl+1..9 select tab.
.TP
.B Splits
Ctrl+Shift+E split vertically, Ctrl+Shift+O split horizontally,
Alt+arrows move focus, Ctrl+Shift+Z zoom pane.
.TP
.B Clipboard
Ctrl+Shift+C copy, Ctrl+Shift+V paste, middle-click PRIMARY paste (X11).
.TP
.B Font
Ctrl+Shift++/= zoom in, Ctrl+Shift+-/_- zoom out, Ctrl+Shift+0/) reset.
.TP
.B Search
Ctrl+Shift+F open search, Enter next match, Shift+Enter previous, Esc close.
.TP
.B Palette
Ctrl+Shift+P open command palette.
.TP
.B HUD
Ctrl+Shift+Alt+F toggle performance HUD.
.SH CONFIGURATION
Configuration is stored in TOML format at $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/neoterm/config.toml
(or ~/.config/neoterm/config.toml). The file is watched for changes and
reloaded automatically.
.SH FILES
.TP
~/.config/neoterm/config.toml
User configuration.
.TP
~/.local/share/neoterm/sessions/
Saved sessions directory.
